    "created_at": "2015-10-08T16:15:21Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-10-08T16:15:21Z",
    "body": "Further, I think that every other mention in [§12.2.4.*](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/syntax.html#tokenization) should also be updated. [§12.1.2.6](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/syntax.html#cdata-rcdata-restrictions), [§12.2.5.4.*](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/syntax.html#parsing-main-inhtml), and [§12.2.5.5](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/syntax.html#parsing-main-inforeign) are already good.\n",
